<title>SINGAPORE: New Toyo hits a high of S$0.85 at open.</title>
<headline>New Toyo hits a high of S$0.85 at open.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Toyo International Holdings Ltd hit a high of Singapore $0.85 at open against its initial public offer (IPO) at S$0.80 on Friday.</p>
</text>
